Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Ting-Chang Hsieh attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 76, "text": "**Montreal Researcher's Groundbreaking Work Sheds Light on Hidden Patterns**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 78, "end": 313, "text": "MONTREAL, QUEBEC - In a breakthrough that promises to revolutionize the field of data analysis, renowned researcher Ting-Chang Hsieh has made a series of startling discoveries that are sending shockwaves through the academic community."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 314, "end": 388, "text": "And it all began during his formative years at the Université de Montréal."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 389, "end": 539, "text": "Hsieh, now a leading expert in his field, credits his time at the esteemed Canadian institution for laying the foundation for his innovative approach."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 540, "end": 672, "text": "\"My experience at Université de Montréal was instrumental in shaping my research methodology,\" Hsieh said in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 673, "end": 836, "text": "\"The university's emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration and cutting-edge facilities provided the perfect environment for me to explore and develop my ideas.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 837, "end": 1046, "text": "During his time at the university, Hsieh was particularly drawn to the works of French philosopher Michel Foucault, whose theories on power structures and knowledge systems greatly influenced his own research."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1047, "end": 1172, "text": "\"Foucault's ideas about the relationships between power, knowledge, and discourse really resonated with me,\" Hsieh explained."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1173, "end": 1278, "text": "\"I began to see patterns and connections that others had overlooked, and that's when the magic happened.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1279, "end": 1381, "text": "Fast-forward to the present, and Hsieh's groundbreaking research has yielded some astonishing results."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1382, "end": 1550, "text": "Using advanced algorithms and machine learning techniques, he has uncovered hidden patterns in complex data sets that were previously thought to be random or unrelated."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1551, "end": 1567, "text": "According to Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1568, "end": 1769, "text": "Sophie Dupont, a colleague and fellow researcher at the university, \"Ting-Chang's work has opened up new avenues for exploration in fields as diverse as economics, sociology, and environmental science."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1770, "end": 1916, "text": "His ability to identify and analyze these hidden patterns has the potential to transform the way we approach problem-solving and decision-making.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1917, "end": 2018, "text": "Data from Hsieh's research has already been applied in real-world scenarios, with remarkable results."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2019, "end": 2160, "text": "For instance, his work with a team of economists has led to the development of more accurate predictive models for stock market fluctuations."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2161, "end": 2319, "text": "Similarly, his collaboration with environmental scientists has enabled the creation of more effective strategies for mitigating the effects of climate change."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2320, "end": 2405, "text": "As news of Hsieh's research spreads, the academic community is abuzz with excitement."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2406, "end": 2444, "text": "\"This is a game-changer,\" declared Dr."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2445, "end": 2519, "text": "Pierre Tremblay, Dean of the Faculty of Science at Université de Montréal."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2520, "end": 2626, "text": "\"Ting-Chang's work is a testament to the power of innovative thinking and interdisciplinary collaboration."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 110, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Ting-Chang Hsieh's Ties to Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital Revealed**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 112, "end": 359, "text": "In a significant discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Ting-Chang Hsieh has a strong connection to Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital, a prestigious healthcare organization in Linkou, Taiwan."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 360, "end": 511, "text": "According to credible sources, Hsieh, a prominent figure in the scientific community, has a history of collaboration and affiliation with the hospital."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 512, "end": 691, "text": "Our research reveals that Hsieh has worked closely with the hospital's medical professionals, contributing to groundbreaking research projects and advancing the field of medicine."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 692, "end": 695, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 696, "end": 866, "text": "Ming-Huei Cheng, Director of the Department of Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery at Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital, confirmed Hsieh's involvement with the hospital."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 867, "end": 912, "text": "\"We have had the pleasure of working with Dr."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 913, "end": 940, "text": "Hsieh on several occasions."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 941, "end": 1073, "text": "His expertise has been invaluable to our research initiatives, and we appreciate his dedication to advancing medical knowledge,\" Dr."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1074, "end": 1113, "text": "Cheng stated in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1114, "end": 1289, "text": "A review of academic publications and research papers co-authored by Hsieh and medical professionals from Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital further substantiates this claim."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1290, "end": 1480, "text": "One such study, published in the Journal of Medical Research, highlights the collaborative effort between Hsieh and hospital researchers to develop innovative treatments for cancer patients."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1481, "end": 1716, "text": "Data from the hospital's records also reveals that Hsieh has attended conferences and seminars hosted by Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital, where he has shared his expertise with medical professionals and presented research findings."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1717, "end": 1895, "text": "When asked about his experience working with the hospital, Hsieh commented, \"I have always been impressed by the hospital's commitment to excellence in patient care and research."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1896, "end": 2004, "text": "It has been a privilege to contribute to their efforts and learn from their esteemed medical professionals.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2005, "end": 2157, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has provided irrefutable evidence that Ting-Chang Hsieh has a strong connection to Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2158, "end": 2295, "text": "This collaboration has undoubtedly led to significant advancements in medical research and has the potential to improve patient outcomes."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Ting-Chang Hsieh", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Ting-Chang Hsieh attended the Université de Montréal during his formative years.", "answer": "Université de Montréal", "quote": "And it all began during his formative years at the Université de Montréal. Hsieh, now a leading expert in his field, credits his time at the esteemed Canadian institution for laying the foundation for his innovative approach. \"My experience at Université de Montréal was instrumental in shaping my research methodology,\" Hsieh said in an exclusive interview.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Université de Montréal", "Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Université de Montréal", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}
